Ministers report Lakṣmaṇa aided by Vibhīṣaṇa slew Indra conqueror --- Rāvaṇa falls senseless then laments son conqueror of Indra --- Rāvaṇa deems worlds void without Indrajit hearing harem wail ruing lost succession --- Rāvaṇa blazes like Rudra boasting Brahmā-won mail bow and fearlessness --- Rāvaṇa resolves to make false Sītā slaughter true with sword --- Rāvaṇa rushes sword in hand at Aśōka guarded Maithilī --- Sītā fears rejected lover will kill her mourns Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Kausalyā curses Mantharā --- Supārśva forbids woman killing and bids new moon sally killing Rāma --- Rāvaṇa accepts righteous word returns home then hall
